Click here to begin.
:SET face=eye_closed
@intro
:SET name_shared=false
:SET cafe_mentioned=false
:SET window_reason_given=false
:SET house_confronted=false
Welcome to the Conduit.
:SET face=eye_open
The Conduit connects you with those who have passed.

Before establishing communication, know these ground rules:
@rules
1. Do not ask them about the afterlife.
2. Do not ask them about their state or existence.
3. Do not ask about their death-
   -or the circumstances around their death.
Any of these will cause them major distress and will end the session.
Do you understand these terms? {
    ?: Yes
    ?: No
        You must accept these terms to continue.
        Do you need them to be reiterated? {
            ?: Yes
                -> rules
            ?: No, I accept the terms.
        }
}

# ------ Phase 1: Establish The Gameplay Loop + Minor Strange Tension.
Terms accepted.
@start
Who do you wish to speak to? {
    ?: My wife
        Establishing connection...
    ?: My wife, $hername.
        Establishing connection...
        :SET name_shared=true
        :SIGNAL set_name_shared
}
Please wait... 
Your consciousness is now being mapped to the target's vestige...
...
:SET face=clo_neu
{
    ?: Hey.
}
Hey, it has been a while.
:SET face=neu_smile
{
    ?: How are you?
        I am...
        :SET face=concern_surprise
        How... 
        I-
        :SET face=concern_sfrown
        ->gameover
    ?: It is good to see you.
        It is good to be seen.
    ?: Can you see me?
        I-
        :SET face=concern_sfrown
        Why can't I...
        No.
        Please don't ask me that.
        :SET face=soft_frown
        -> gameover
}
I missed you. Where have you been?
:SET face=neu_sfrown
{
    ?: You died.
        I know that.
        :SET face=aclo_flat
        @whynotearlier
        Why didn't you try to talk to me earlier?
        :SET face=anger_flat
        {
            ?: I couldn't.
                Why not? {
                    ?: The technology did not exist yet.
                        The technology?
                        :SET face=neu_concern
                        What are you talking about?
                        Are you not here?
                        :SET face=concern_tfrown
                        Why can't I see you?
                        Why are you-
                        -> gameover
                    ?: Life moves on... {
                        ?: It's not like I could just drop everything.
                        Oh, but it's so convenient now?
                        :SET face=anger_sopen
                        {
                            ?: That's not what I meant!
                                Then what did you mean?
                                Let me explain something to you.
                                I have been here, waiting.
                                This whole time.
                                There is nothing here.
                                -> onlymemories
                            ?: No, I- {
                                ?: I'm sorry.
                                    -> missedsorry
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            ?: It has not been that long.
                Don't lie to me, it has been years...
                :SET face=anger_sopen
                {
                    ?: How do you know that?
                        Because- 
                        ...
                        :SET face=anger_sfrown
                        I have sat here, waiting...
                        for all that time.
                        @onlymemories
                        I can't do anything except entertain myself with memories.
                        :SET face=neu_concern
                        There is nothing else I can do but remember. 
                        There is nothing else I can feel but what-
                        -I...
                        Why have you taken so long?
                        :SET face=concern_tfrown
                        -> gameover
                }
            ?: I'm sorry.
                @missedsorry
                It's okay.
                :SET face=soft_tfrown
                # should be the only possible exit out of this skip.
            ?: Have you been waiting this whole time?
                Yes.
                :SET face=aclo_frown
                There is...
                There is nothing here.
                ...
                -> onlymemories
        }
    ?: It's hard to explain.
        Hard to explain what? That I am dead?
        :SET face=aclo_surprise
        Do you think I can't tell?
        You know what I meant.
        -> whynotearlier
    ?: Do you remember what happened?
        No.
        :SET face=concern_grimace
        No no no-
        Don't make me think about that.
        -> gameover
}

# --- Phase 2: Some basic conversations and reminiscing to establish a "baseline"

You still do that, you know.
:SET face=neu_smile
{
    ?: Do what?
}
Take too long to say what you mean.
...
You used to just stand there-
-waiting for everything to click.
For it all to make sense to you.
Even when I asked you the simplest things. {
    ?: Like what?
    ?: I don't remember that.
        You don't?
        :SET face=concern_tfrown
        It was...
}
Anything, really.
You always wanted the answer to be right.
:SET face=clo_grin
When I met you, I thought you were just indecisive.
:SET face=clo_smile
But no,
you really would just take your time.
...
Remember how often we would have to send the waitress back?
:SET face=cdev_grin
Because you still weren't ready to order.
You would always ask a million questions about the food:
What to pair with it...
If it was the sort of thing you'd regret picking...
You would stare at the menu like it mattered.
:SET face=neu_smile
Like you could pick wrong. {
    ?: Where was this?
        Everywhere!
        :SET face=clo_bgrin
        Didn't matter where we were.
        Every pit-stop was special,
        or you would want to make it special.
    ?: That doesn't sound like me.
        Really?
        :SET face=neu_surprise
        Maybe you just never noticed... 
        Or you're too embarrassed to admit it.
        :SET face=soft_tgrin
    ?: "What to pair with it...?"
        Huh?
        :SET face=concern_surprise
        {
            ?: I don't drink.
                Oh, I meant uh- 
                Never mind.
                :SET face=concern_sfrown
                ...
        }
}
I appreciated that about you, you know...
:SET face=neu_smile
Made all our days more vivid.
:SET face=soft_tgrin
...
:SET face=neu_concern
Especially at-
...
#@debug
We would always go to that one place... {
