        But this place more than anywhere else.
}
...
I can still picture it.
:SET face=clo_grin
The view of the city, the port in the distance...
...
[branch]
    [when:cafe_mentioned=true]
        We always sat at the same spot, right?
        :SET face=neu_grin
        {
